<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 12/13.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 12/13.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for June</p>
<p>12/13. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	   June 12/13	  June 11/12</p>
<p> CZK	0.42818	     0.42598</p>
<p> DKK	2.10149	     2.10113</p>
<p> FIM	2.66533	     2.66123</p>
<p> HUF	0.0747		0.07461</p>
<p> JPY	0.12079	     0.12345</p>
<p> LTL	3.44938	     3.42379</p>
<p> LVL     24.13785	    24.20857</p>
<p> RUR	0.00239	     0.00238</p>
<p> SEK	1.77336	     1.76514</p>
<p> UAH	7.4405		7.39405</p>
<p> USD     13.7984	     13.696</p>
<p> XEU     15.59564	    15.56345</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
